        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Aniu ringpui tingmik maan pukhou,",
            "Kanloumei pu Paubaomei ta hou puni;",
            "Khou tei ai neihlamei tuai lak khe,",
            "Kalun tingkao mun kumna puang puni e.",
            "",
            "He! Ringhmei thingbang lim khou tei,",
            "Tingkauh meiguai neihlana puai,",
            "Mbaan thai puni hei khou tei,",
            "Israel chingbut than bam khou.",
            "",
            "2. Namdaih pang khou kalangh bam sini,",
            "Hei khou tei lungh rianramei tei nai sini;",
            "Tarou khou zeihang rui ‘zianloumei,",
            "Ntam puni e hei kandi khou hei.",
            "",
            "3. Kumna tat di kho Zion Na guai,",
            "Katik kagun daihpui ram tei ‘naguang the;",
            "Ntau kapma rianra bam sini,",
            "Akhang neihlamei tingkao mun tei puang the.",
            "",
            "4. Kumna gaimei namdaih tang pukhou,",
            "Kandi rianramei ram hei ningdat lak khe;",
            "Lauziu Na le Guangh daihmei ram tei,",
            "Zau nimei le neihlamei tiloumei Pu."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
